{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\" event:schema=\"event-schemas/missing.json\"/>\n    <transition event=\"refund\" target=\"done\" event:schema=\"../order.json\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/event004-missing-schema-file.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event004-missing-schema-file.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":85,"endLine":5,"startColumn":59,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the schema file `event-schemas/missing.json` of `<transition>` is not available\n\n**Note:** a schema reference names a JSON file by a path relative to the document, at or below its directory; the compiler reads it at compile time and embeds the schema in the Machine IR, so nothing is read or fetched while a document runs\n\n**Help:** create the file, correct the path, or write the schema inline","text":"the schema file `event-schemas/missing.json` of `<transition>` is not available"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":290,"start":264},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT004"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event004-missing-schema-file.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":73,"endLine":6,"startColumn":60,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the schema file `../order.json` of `<transition>` is not available\n\n**Note:** a schema reference names a JSON file by a path relative to the document, at or below its directory;